--

COMMENT ON TABLE public.intake_submissions IS 'Externally-captured new-client intake (currently the Netlify-hosted form). Netlify Forms remains the capture layer; this is the durable system of record. Free-text answers live in answers jsonb; safety-critical fields are normalized into client_allergies and client_dietary_restrictions.';

